  message: "Closing: superseded by the respawn-on-circuit-breaker mechanism (new tracker item). Restating the prohibition louder in AGENTS.md would not have changed last session's behavior — the agent already had the rules and ignored them. Replacing a stagnating context with a fresh detached tmux session for the same vendor is a structural fix, not a governance one."  # 0ed2
